### Health
GET http://localhost:8787/health

### Echo dengan query
GET http://localhost:8787/echo?topik=http&page=2

### Echo dengan body JSON
POST http://localhost:8787/echo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pesan": "halo HTTP",
  "topik": "request-response"
}

### Daftar produk
GET http://localhost:8787/products?page=1&limit=2

### Buat produk
POST http://localhost:8787/products
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: contoh-produk-001

{
  "name": "Gula Aren",
  "price": 25000,
  "stock": 20
}

### Detail produk
GET http://localhost:8787/products/1

### Ubah stok
PATCH http://localhost:8787/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock": 10
}

### Login user
POST http://localhost:8787/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "nina",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}

### Profil dengan bearer token
GET http://localhost:8787/profile
Authorization: Bearer GANTI_DENGAN_TOKEN

### Admin dengan bearer token
GET http://localhost:8787/admin
Authorization: Bearer GANTI_DENGAN_TOKEN

### Cache
GET http://localhost:8787/cache

### Cache dengan validasi ETag
GET http://localhost:8787/cache
If-None-Match: "GANTI_DENGAN_ETAG"

### Content negotiation
GET http://localhost:8787/negotiate
Accept: application/json

### Preflight CORS
OPTIONS http://localhost:8787/cors
Origin: http://localhost:8123
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST

### Range request
GET http://localhost:8787/range/sample.txt
Range: bytes=0-9

### Simulasi status
GET http://localhost:8787/status/422

### Reset data lab
POST http://localhost:8787/reset
